#. (itstool) path: info/desc
#: C/raw.page:7
msgid "More about RAW support in Shotwell."
msgstr "Meir om RAW-støtte i Shotwell."

#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/raw.page:12
msgid "RAW support in Shotwell"
msgstr "RAW-støtte i Shotwell"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/raw.page:13
msgid ""
"Some cameras have the ability to store data directly off the sensor and into "
"a file that contains extra color information; this is commonly referred to "
"as 'RAW' or 'camera RAW', and Shotwell supports these files as well."
msgstr ""
"Nokre kamera kan lagre data direkte frå sensoren i ei fil med ekstra "
"fargeinformasjon. Dette vert gjerne kalla «RAW» eller «kamera-RAW», og "
"Shotwell støttar òg slike filer."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/raw.page:18
msgid ""
"Since RAW photographs normally cannot be displayed directly, but must be "
"first developed - that is, have their extra information interpreted and "
"readied for displaying - most cameras will either embed a JPEG inside a RAW-"
"format file, or produce a JPEG alongside the RAW file at the time the "
"snapshot is taken. The latter is referred to throughout this document as "
"RAW+JPEG. If you import a RAW+JPEG pair, Shotwell will keep them paired and "
"treat them as one item in your library."
msgstr ""
"Fordi RAW-bilete vanlegvis ikkje kan visast direkte, men først må "
"framkallast – det vil seie at den ekstra informasjonen vert tolka og gjort "
"klar til vising – legg dei fleste kamera anten inn ein JPEG i RAW-fila eller"
" lagar ein JPEG ved sidan av RAW-fila når biletet vert teke. Den siste "
"varianten vert kalla RAW+JPEG i dette dokumentet. Viss du importerer eit "
"RAW+JPEG-par, held Shotwell dei saman og handsamar dei som eitt element i "
"biblioteket ditt."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/raw.page:27
msgid ""
"When you import a RAW file, you can choose to either use the camera's "
"internally-developed JPEG or Shotwell's by selecting <guiseq><gui>Photos</"
"gui><gui>Developer</gui></guiseq> in the menus."
msgstr ""
"Når du importerer ei RAW-fil, kan du velje om du vil bruke JPEG-biletet som "
"kameraet har framkalla, eller Shotwell sitt, ved å velje "
"<guiseq><gui>Bilete</gui><gui>Framkalling</gui></guiseq> i menyane."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/raw.page:33
msgid ""
"Changing between developers will cause all edits made to a photograph to be "
"discarded."
msgstr ""
"Viss du byter framkallar, vert alle redigeringar du har gjort på eit bilete,"
" forkasta."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/raw.page:39
msgid ""
"In order to publish or use a RAW photograph in most other software, it has "
"to be exported first. Shotwell can export your RAW photos in JPEG, PNG, TIFF "
"or BMP format, and, when publishing, will internally export a JPEG version "
"for you and publish that."
msgstr ""
"For å publisere eller bruke eit RAW-bilete i dei fleste andre program må det"
" først eksporterast. Shotwell kan eksportere RAW-bileta dine i JPEG-, PNG-, "
"TIFF- eller BMP-format, og ved publisering eksporterer Shotwell ein JPEG-"
"versjon internt og publiserer han."

#. (itstool) path: info/desc
#: C/organize-remove.page:7
msgid ""
"Remove photos from the library, or delete them from your computer entirely."
