"<keyseq><key>Ctrl</key>0</keyseq> for heile biletet, "
"<keyseq><key>Ctrl</key>1</keyseq> for 100 % (1 biletpiksel = 1 skjermpiksel)"
" og <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key>2</keyseq> for 200 % (1 biletpiksel = 2 × 2 "
"skjermpikslar)."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/view-displaying.page:20
msgid ""
"Shotwell offers a fullscreen mode to display photos. Choose "
